h="wet/burgerShot/burger2_640.jpg" hi="wet/burgerShot/burger2_1280.jpg" embed="wet/burgerShot/burger2_640.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">It's a wonderful place to work, especially if you're interested in flipping burgers for a living.</media><media thumb="wet/burgerShot/burger3_120.jpg" path="wet/burgerShot/burger3_640.jpg" hi="wet/burgerShot/burger3_1280.jpg" embed="wet/burgerShot/burger3_640.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">We hired a top architect. Unfortunately, things did not work out, so our restaurants got designed by a moron.</media></screen></item><item id="middlePark" name="Middle Park" point_name="Middle Park" borough="algonquin"><desc>The lungs of the city.</desc><thumb path="wet/middlepark/middlepark1_178.jpg" /><screen><media thumb="wet/middlepark/middlepark1_120.jpg" path="wet/middlepark/middlepark1_640.jpg" hi="wet/middlepark/middlepark1_1280.jpg" embed="wet/middlepark/middlepark1_640.jpg" display="yes" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">The lungs of the city.</media><media thumb="wet/middlepark/middlepark2_120.jpg" path="wet/middlepark/middlepark2_640.jpg" hi="wet/middlepark/middlepark2_1280.jpg" embed="wet/middlepark/middlepark2_640.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">Street musicians and other freeloaders who don't pay any taxes also enjoy Middle Park. </media><media thumb="wet/middlepark/middlepark3_120.jpg" path="wet/middlepark/middlepark3_640.jpg" hi="wet/middlepark/middlepark3_1280.jpg" embed="wet/middlepark/middlepark3_640.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">People with no sense of shame exercise in public in the park.</media></screen></item><item id="boothTunnel" name="The Booth Tunnel" point_name="The Booth Tunnel" borough="alderney"><desc>Popular commuter tunnel.</desc><thumb path="wet/boothTunnel/booth_178x100.jpg" /><screen><media thumb="wet/boothTunnel/booth_120x68.jpg" path="wet/boothTunnel/booth_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/boothTunnel/booth_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/boothTunnel/booth_640x360.jpg" display="yes" enlarge="yes" multilines="yes">Tunnel allowing some people to work in the city and pay much less tax - in exchange for living in a featureless suburban swamp.</media></screen></item><item id="playboyX" name="Playboy X" point_name="Playboy X" borough="algonquin"><desc>Philanthropist, philosopher and business man, Playboy X.</desc><thumb path="wet/playboyX/playboy1_178x100.jpg" /><video><media thumb="wet/playboyX/playboy_vid120.jpg" stillFrame="wet/playboyX/playboy_vid640.jpg" path="wet/playboyX/playboy.flv" embed="wet/playboyX/playboySmaller.flv" embedcover="playboyX.jpg" display="yes" multilines="0">Philanthropist, philosopher and business man, Playboy X.</media></video><screen><media thumb="wet/playboyX/playboy1_120x68.jpg" path="wet/playboyX/playboy1_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/playboyX/playboy1_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/playboyX/playboy1_640x360.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">Philanthropist, philosopher and business man, Playboy X.</media></screen></item><item id="bleedar" name="Bledar Morina" point_name="Bledar Morina" borough="broker"><desc>Albanian thug and fitness enthusiast.</desc><thumb path="wet/bledar/bledar_178.jpg" /><screen><media thumb="wet/bledar/bledar_120.jpg" path="wet/bledar/bledar_640.jpg" hi="wet/bledar/bledar_1280.jpg" embed="wet/bledar/bledar_640.jpg" display="yes" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">Albanian money lender, blackmailer, thug and fitness enthusiast, Bledar Morina.</media></screen></item><item id="philBell" name="Phil Bell" point_name="Phil Bell" borough="alderney"><desc>Alderney businessman Phil Bell.</desc><thumb path="wet/philBell/phil_vid178.jpg" /><video><media thumb="wet/philBell/phil_vid120.jpg" stillFrame="wet/philBell/phil_vid640.jpg" path="wet/philBell/philbell.flv" embed="wet/philBell/philbellSmaller.flv" embedcover="phil.jpg" display="yes" multilines="0">Alderney businessman Phil Bell.</media></video></item><item id="packieMcreary" name="Packie McReary" point_name="Packie McReary" borough="dukes"><desc>Hard-living Irish-American Patrick McReary.</desc><thumb path="wet/packieMcreary/packie1_178.jpg" /><video><media thumb="wet/packieMcreary/packie_120x68.jpg" stillFrame="wet/packieMcreary/packie_640x360.jpg" path="wet/packieMcreary/packie.flv" embed="wet/packieMcreary/packieSmaller.flv" embedcover="packie.jpg" display="yes" multilines="0">Mr. Patrick McReary in action.</media></video><screen><media thumb="wet/packieMcreary/packie1_120.jpg" path="wet/packieMcreary/packie1_640.jpg" hi="wet/packieMcreary/packie1_1280.jpg" embed="wet/packieMcreary/packie1_640.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">Hard-living Irish-American Patrick McReary.</media><media thumb="wet/packieMcreary/packie2_120.jpg" path="wet/packieMcreary/packie2_640.jpg" hi="wet/packieMcreary/packie2_1280.jpg" embed="wet/packieMcreary/packie2_640.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">Patrick in a rare quiet moment, between getting drunk and having a fight.</media></screen></item><item id="steinway" name="Steinway Beer Garden" point_name="Steinway Beer Garden" borough="dukes"><desc>Popular but culturally confused watering hole.</desc><thumb path="wet/steinway/Steinway_178x100.jpg" /><video><media thumb="wet/steinway/Steinway_120x68.jpg" stillFrame="wet/steinway/Steinway_640x360.jpg" path="wet/steinway/steinway.flv" embed="wet/steinway/steinwaySmaller.flv" embedcover="steinway.jpg" display="yes" multilines="0">Popular, but culturally confused, part-Irish part-German watering hole.</media></video><screen><media thumb="wet/steinway/steinway2_120x68.jpg" path="wet/steinway/steinway2_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/steinway/steinway2_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/steinway/steinway2_640x360.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">What better social activity for the heavily inebriated than throwing pointed objects around?</media><media thumb="wet/steinway/steinway3_120x68.jpg" path="wet/steinway/steinway3_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/steinway/steinway3_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/steinway/steinway3_640x360.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">She doesn't get anywhere near as many tips as the girl with the overly friendly demeanor and the heaving chest.</media></screen></item><item id="dawkins" name="Deputy Mayor Bryce Dawkins" point_name="Bryce Dawkins" borough="algonquin"><desc>Deputy Mayor of Liberty City</desc><thumb path="wet/bryceDawkins/bryce_178x100.jpg" /><screen><media thumb="wet/bryceDawkins/bryce_120x68.jpg" path="wet/bryceDawkins/bryce_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/bryceDawkins/bryce_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/bryceDawkins/bryce_640x360.jpg" display="yes" enlarge="no" multilines="no">Ultra-conservative Deputy Mayor who will ram family values down your throat.</media></screen></item><item id="mcreary" name="Francis McReary" point_name="Francis McReary" borough="algonquin"><desc>Rising star of Liberty City's finest.</desc><thumb path="wet/mcreary/mcreary1_178x100.jpg" /><screen><media thumb="wet/mcreary/mcreary1_120x68.jpg" path="wet/mcreary/mcreary1_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/mcreary/mcreary1_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/mcreary/mcreary1_640x360.jpg" display="yes" enlarge="yes" multilines="yes">Rising star of Liberty City's finest.  A policeman from a tough neighborhood, who has forged powerful links with the community and is making a difference on the streets of the roughest parts of town.</media></screen></item><item id="superStarCafe" name="Super Star Cafe" point_name="Super Star Cafe" borough="algonquin"><desc>Stylish eatery with large merchandise department.</desc><thumb path="wet/superStarCafe/superstar1_178x100.jpg" /><screen><media thumb="wet/superStarCafe/superstar1_120x68.jpg" path="wet/superStarCafe/superstar1_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/superStarCafe/superstar1_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/superStarCafe/superstar1_640x360.jpg" display="yes" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">Stylish eatery with large merchandise department. Popular with out-of-towners.</media></screen></item><item id="majesticHotel" name="Majestic Hotel" point_name="Majestic Hotel" borough="algonquin"><desc>Not as majestic as it once was.</desc><thumb path="wet/majesticHotel/majestic1_178x100.jpg" /><screen><media thumb="wet/majesticHotel/majestic1_120x68.jpg" path="wet/majesticHotel/majestic1_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/majesticHotel/majestic1_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/majesticHotel/majestic1_640x360.jpg" display="yes" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">Roof of the Majestic Hotel. Not as majestic as it once was, the hotel is still popular with people who don’t know better.</media><media thumb="wet/majesticHotel/majestic2_120x68.jpg" path="wet/majesticHotel/majestic2_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/majesticHotel/majestic2_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/majesticHotel/majestic2_640x360.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">The bar at The Majestic was once popular with writers and artists. Now its popular with traveling salesmen.</media></screen></item><item id="69streetDiner" name="69th Street Diner" point_name="69th Street Diner" borough="broker"><desc>Who could resist its greasy allure?</desc><thumb path="wet/69streetDiner/69thstreet1_178x100.jpg" /><screen><media thumb="wet/69streetDiner/69thstreet1_120x68.jpg" path="wet/69streetDiner/69thstreet1_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/69streetDiner/69thstreet1_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/69streetDiner/69thstreet1_640x360.jpg" display="yes" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">A classic diner, with a classic name. Who could resist its greasy allure? </media><media thumb="wet/69streetDiner/69thstreet2_120x68.jpg" path="wet/69streetDiner/69thstreet2_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/69streetDiner/69thstreet2_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/69streetDiner/69thstreet2_640x360.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">You remember the famous scene in the movie about the couple who fall in and out of love? That wasn't filmed here. </media></screen></item><item id="bellicR" name="Roman Bellic" point_name="Roman Bellic" borough="broker"><desc>Successful entrepreneur Roman Bellic.</desc><thumb path="wet/romanBellic/roman_vidcap178.jpg" /><video><media thumb="wet/romanBellic/roman_vidcap120.jpg" stillFrame="wet/romanBellic/roman_vidcap640.jpg" path="wet/romanBellic/roman.flv" embed="wet/romanBellic/romanSmaller.flv" embedcover="roman.jpg" display="yes" multilines="0">Roman Bellic has lived in Liberty City for 15 years.</media></video><screen><media thumb="wet/romanBellic/roman1_120x68.jpg" path="wet/romanBellic/roman1_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/romanBellic/roman1_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/romanBellic/roman1_640x360.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">Successful entrepreneur Roman Bellic.</media></screen></item><item id="glebov" name="Vlad Glebov" point_name="Vlad Glebov" borough="broker"><desc>Russian-born money lender.</desc><thumb path="wet/vladGlebov/vlad_vidcap178.jpg" /><video><media thumb="wet/vladGlebov/vlad_vidcap120.jpg" stillFrame="wet/vladGlebov/vlad_vidcap640.jpg" path="wet/vladGlebov/vlad.flv" embed="wet/vladGlebov/vladSmaller.flv" embedcover="vlad.jpg" display="yes" multilines="0">Russian-born money lender, bully, top international business man and patron of the bar Comrades.</media></video><screen><media thumb="wet/vladGlebov/vlad1_120x68.jpg" path="wet/vladGlebov/vlad1_640x360.jpg" hi="wet/vladGlebov/vlad1_1280x720.jpg" embed="wet/vladGlebov/vlad1_640x360.jpg" display="no" enlarge="yes" multilines="no">Vlad considers himself to be a charming, debonair man of the world. Vlad is not big on self-knowledge.</media></screen></item><item id="escuela" name="Manny Escuela" point_name="Manny Escuela" borough="bohan"><desc>Tough-talking community leader from South Bohan.</desc><thumb path="wet/mannyEscuela/manny_vidcap178.jpg" /><video><media thumb="wet/mannyEscuela/manny_vidcap120.jpg" stillFrame="wet/mannyEscuela/manny_vidcap640.jpg" path="wet/mannyEscuela/manny.flv" embed="wet/mannyEscuela/mannySmaller.flv" embedcover="manny.jpg" display="yes" multilines="0">Manny is very interested in giving back to the community.  He's even more interested in being filmed while giving back.</media></video><screen><media thumb="wet/mannyEscuela/ma